# landmark (assets/world3d/strand/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Soggy Bottom Strand: a plank pier with a T-head running out over the north-west sea on its piles, a rowing boat moored by it, a fisher's hut on stilts in the north-east water, a whale-rib arch over the north gate.
# the pier: decking, a wider head at the far end, piles down both sides, a lamp post
